---
description: "Security checklist for a change: roles, validation, secrets, personal data (attach via @security-checklist)"
alwaysApply: false
---

Check the change against the list:
- there are no secrets, tokens or real personal data in code, tests and fixtures;
- every endpoint checks the role: a student sees only their own submissions;
- input data is validated by a schema, and SQL is built through parameters;
- the texts of students' work and their identifiers are not written to logs;
- new dependencies have an explanation and a pinned version.
